8711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107655","id":2983058711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xzd0X","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T07:43:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T07:43:25Z","body":"> I did a bisect and it looks like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107345 fixed it from that, to what we currently see. Per clay's comment on that PR, perhaps something in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106267 caused this?\n\nIndeed, that is likely the cause. Due to the way that OpenXR works we create an RGBA8_SRGB texture instead of an RGBA8 texture as we use internally. That would do a hardware SRGB -> linear conversion when reading from that texture and indeed explains the issue.\n\nI'll find some time to resolve this, now that its a fragment shader I can look into re-introducing lens distortion as well, which is something we lost.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983058711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]